# Forgepoint model-serving PLACEHOLDER artifact.
#
# This is NOT a real ONNX model. It exists so a freshly-deployed model-serving pod
# has a fetchable artifact at file:///artifacts/placeholder.onnx, letting the
# FileFetcher fetch+hash it and the PLACEHOLDER inference engine (see main.go's
# newPlaceholderEngine — the real ONNX adapter is a flagged follow-up) report
# StateReady so /readyz goes green out of the box on a default deploy.
#
# A real per-model Deployment overrides FP_ARTIFACT_URI with a presigned https:// URL
# (registry-minted) or a CSI-mounted file path and ships the real ONNX bytes; this
# placeholder is only the default so the chart runs without external object storage.
PLACEHOLDER-ONNX-DO-NOT-USE-FOR-INFERENCE
